From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] luma: dock tiles show their windows and preview them on hover

Each running dock tile marks its windows: a pill for the focused window, a dot for every other open window, a hollow ring for a minimized one, and a small extra dot when there are more than three. Hovering a tile whose app has windows shows live previews of those windows instead of the name tooltip, and the tooltip and previews follow the light, frost, glass and dark surface looks. The previews live in js/ui/lumaDockWindows.js.
---
